{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:30 2026-08-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「美心妹妹」楊鎧凝（Celine），轉眼間已經18歲，長得亭亭玉立，她除了專注於在日本的學業外，近日在社交平台分享飛往泰國曼谷旅遊度假的靚相，更上載了一系列池畔泳裝，大晒青春活力，雖然她仍然保留童顏，但身材已經頗有肉地，照片曝光後隨即引來大批網民熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>楊鎧凝成人禮泳衣大解放</h2>\n<p>從楊鎧凝分享的照片中可見，身在曼谷的她盡情享受當地的陽光，並興奮發文寫道：「喺泰國緊係游水enjoy sunshine 啦！」相中的她身穿一套黑白配色，設有荷葉邊及白色喱士的兩件頭泳裝，雖然她已經成年，上圍亦十分豐滿，但仍然保持童顏，她將長髮盤成清爽的丸子頭，時而在泳池邊對鏡頭展露招牌甜美笑容，時而伏在池畔享受清涼快感，展現出滿滿的少女感。除了泳裝照外，她此行亦體驗了穿著泰國傳統服飾以及LV展覽，行程相當豐富充實。</p>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝經常參演無綫劇集。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bac908d225be9b1891989dccd3a88f2/2022-12/10494840_672926372785912_8770976321088486541_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝曾與不少大明星合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/785fd5d973d9c192213429175c7fcb14/2022-12/10423845_672925102786039_1377515636748989299_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝（Celine）當年因為拍攝美心廣告後被封為「美心妹妹」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/249a876bdf7d92eeabead682731545fb/2022-12/1505237_578658652212685_37467341_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"昔日年幼的楊鎧凝可愛靈動，圓圓大眼與嘟嘴模樣深得觀眾喜愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ca88f58faf8a36abbaf727f47372cb4/2026-08/10480184_672925256119357_7939853671059629859_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日楊鎧凝在社交平台晒出黑白荷葉邊泳裝，對鏡頭展露甜美燦爛笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/680aeab94e5ce28a03922710f1ff1ae0/2026-08/SaveClip_App_782888692_18330948169287688_5227905332106353676_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"轉眼間已經18歲的楊鎧凝，紮起清爽丸子頭，舉手投足間散發少女活力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60afc7b834f200d1f4eedb9a03c27a86/2026-08/SaveClip_App_784716675_18330948190287688_5819602495806173405_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"迎著曼谷陽光微風，楊鎧凝大方展現健康自然的青春魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75b5da4565dbe86e42a22d73aefb620d/2026-08/SaveClip_App_785913630_18330948199287688_5002163459801430615_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝在泳池中暢泳消暑，大讚泰國陽光極具度假氛圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/757b60f8e70a30898a174d0a4f685470/2026-08/SaveClip_App_785993060_18330948160287688_2031010975038907788_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝換上粉金色泰國傳統服裝合十拍照，體驗當地文化。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/271013f15e48ec18fec58e2cc59037b9/2026-08/SaveClip_App_786035673_18385855522229398_5203709341656903477_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝身穿小背心熱褲參觀LV展覽，打扮充滿夏日氣息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0df52eae85f84fd888cd4ce58828103f/2026-08/SaveClip_App_786492685_18386022196229398_4236950993657418244_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝參觀動漫展覽，行程豐富又充實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05796e52088df39108afe4e82c865b75/2026-08/SaveClip_App_786492687_18386022205229398_5894445079385658251_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝漸漸長大成少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/095cceb267fbbdd8f9b7559c709b9801/2024-04/91970cfa-9d2a-4a19-90b5-7a7be26543fe.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝不時在IG分享可愛甜美相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f2b26ee6ec42790596b11edf99780cb/2024-04/435298051_969676334762763_5359861243486769576_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝幾年前在IG透露起程飛日本讀書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54f267422580a5c701cf6d0974c7dcf5/2024-04/310_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝已經變成少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30c2b692da42a211997b35d7bfafd21d/2024-04/311_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝近年喜愛打扮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4631dd4f64a800ac9a4a14071c988bfc/2024-04/434027192_412173831574477_5975711636416901484_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝今年已經17歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/849f7a97fc788fe57474ad17f0e97cbd/2024-04/434300652_412469464806519_5097315603879009265_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝長得亭亭玉立，已經是一位美少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61ea4e7d7850a23956a019f6a72034f0/2024-04/434310277_335453909516884_1798565825811321243_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝愈來愈貪吃，難免心廣體胖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/888aa1f4336652048be2302015bb782b/2026-02/3727961030074224496_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝早前考獲N1證書，可知她的日語水平甚高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b09b1425b7e97579e65a2961ee0be18/2026-02/3743021002965279553_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝長大後，也是臉圓圓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da30011793b7c5d6eb7f50cee11f6e44/2026-02/3756040628833770027_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝進入青春期，長得亭亭玉立。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24d572d00e6fefaa2c4c916d01346c7e/2026-02/3756040629144126911_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝現在有點Baby Fat，應該有得減。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a65dfcba75508e12555997cbe6a5e77/2026-02/3766894347716569520_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝接受電台訪問，非常厲害。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/864418daf2e74380fef4cf40e27dbf82/2026-02/3768469466800890108_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝嗜吃甜點，想瘦有難度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61e972c93c2610aa7ec0aaa09645b1ae/2026-02/3835071407219454748_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝最新近況，是去了東京迪士尼，身形暴脹，網民回憶崩壞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95ca709098948370a0355d6e25d167af/2026-02/3836471259996270636_6759853397.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝早年到日本升學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ca62866ec2a1496d9e36ac65304647b/2024-04/330.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝在IG貼出校服look打鞦韆的照片，勁pure。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83f4317b31255c09bca4382bfd2b708d/2024-04/436496562_1173424716971169_7139612440493102403_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝很快適應日本留學生的生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5028ca47aa2c75b64db3eef1802768aa/2024-04/335.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝開朗的性格，已經融入同學的社交圈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46934236cd7df203c03aaf5ed1a6db21/2024-04/301_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"「美心妹妹」楊鎧凝曾在IG上發佈了一條自己在練唱歌的影片，說自己今次在暑假返港是有重要任務！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e40aa2983367f42f3f039023eec051bf/2024-08/VS--yeungcelineCelineCelineBrianCelineInstagram-0_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝早前在IG分享校園生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51f583134a2939fbd8952cc83ba6e0d8/2024-04/ac27a5db-02f2-4d15-978a-7fba6b17920a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝表示：「呢間學校真係好正！今日去遠足，真係超級好玩，一到識新朋友一度行」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fad6c15c4e93638db510b3a83f4ae857/2024-04/307_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝日語好流利，融入日本校園生活全無難度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/054c7b8178ea37b484876a42c577011a/2024-04/302_5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"穿上體育服的楊鎧凝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/324675f04613a8e7861b498425a656a7/2024-04/436208151_1387967051859805_1669440364477455285_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"校服look的楊鎧凝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08fb345ab70a95490df747c865ef7238/2024-04/333.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝早前曾透露感情狀況，指因身邊的朋友全部都已拍拖，因而令她羨慕想拍拖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16f5c3b0572382c746926c3c156af245/2024-04/435104923_355069514202262_5545638773726951688_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝更分享擇偶條件，要靚仔有活力而且要170cm以上，更希望對方沒有脾氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5277037965be01c46a2a113c3c4b5c76/2024-04/435121592_1154063252431222_77426250789296000_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝一眨眼已經長大成少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79e7715ce4e306de381ce73592c9eb84/2024-04/435893412_444579694679167_6653134604764850453_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝到日本留學，朋友仔跟她道別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a22027c4919f9f4ab4a948f48b41d3/2024-04/433085994_432710012535942_634129473381538148_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>網民讚楊鎧凝「女大十八變」</h2>\n<p>楊鎧凝罕有晒泳裝照，隨即掀起網民熱烈迴響，大讚她「女大十八變」、「越大越靚」。楊鎧凝當年年僅3歲便因拍攝美心廣告一炮而紅，獲封為「美心妹妹」，其後在 TVB劇集《愛我請留言》中飾演可愛的「樂悠悠」，以及參演《陪著你走》、《來自喵喵星的妳》等劇集，精靈討喜的形象深入民心，不少一路看著她成長的網民紛紛感嘆時光飛逝，昔日的「國民妹妹」轉眼已蛻變成陽光美少女。</p>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝早年憑可愛得意的外形而成廣告紅人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a01c390b1b04a66d914bcfa3b92bdfb9/2022-12/1524968_578658618879355_1200450845_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝3歲已入行拍廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a0d3a32bf42b04537473b6707733c64/2022-12/10426736_672928856118997_8089596889249214674_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝外形可愛有觀眾緣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25c6bfa445845d3b885bbc20928abcc7/2022-12/14086437_1083629101715635_6827585510103181891_o.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝小時間已經很可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e25f44e1d65d078d4cdaf2ac19c1ce9f/2022-12/17991359_1308553929223150_6808242965483250608_o.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前楊鎧凝重遇曾合作拍《愛我請留言》的張頴康。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edbbfae5887f9d8b7629684108b037d7/2023-08/celineyeunghongkong_345210694_934689724240988_660305839655175175_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝不時於IG分享近照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bf908a094788d44daacb356d066a095/2022-12/15774644_1206996682712209_7665179406748762381_o.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝日漸長大，多才多藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99a1984ae19542f28a87c958dc92cf8e/2022-12/15774927_1206993812712496_8708481238257389216_o.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"已經逐漸長大的楊鎧凝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9969ae22995f90cab9b4af1fd09b17ae/2022-12/1085008_500678013344083_333008220_o.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不少網民也留言大誇楊鎧凝：「多才多藝」、「又日文又溜冰」 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06e92f6bdad24460fbbe0ca833501789/2022-12/310436693_5459155410829627_7848090176087770319_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝活躍於社交媒體上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c33c8297f67e993f0bd75cd84a6379f/2022-12/311828248_5492730854138749_5844720253078020463_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝可謂暴風式成長。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/000a6e7a6a8d97ac07804270cf132d68/2023-09/celineyeunghongkong_375802906_973540193712507_3669942639856327069_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝未飛日本留學前，也會出席一些公開活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a88a16b325ed8f69bb48f625bee98e0c/2022-12/313266497_5528861490525685_6887910964019659335_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年已經很少在電視廣告中看到楊鎧凝的身影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98012d2c53ad3fc386622b917d186c58/2022-12/316262687_5587624874649346_2269725177297941369_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"但楊鎧凝依然活躍於網上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/619ccd027762da8327cbb6798a13244d/2022-12/316416463_5618789604866206_6093285782308802627_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝更會不時拍攝YouTube介紹美食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f8a102d38894453e9e2cd23d922c898/2022-12/317861041_5626860840725749_2929546759202051442_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝更會不時拍攝YouTube介紹美食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8c25d7d4c016da35a82fa6edab48cd2/2022-12/318067002_5629018777176622_6042136489829884088_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝課餘時間仲接了不少KOL工作以及要經營YouTube頻道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f83dc706142abcb16e9a2519c2c9ffd6/2022-12/317498418_5643076859104147_6933792443378962570_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊鎧凝長高變少女！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35b087acdc7f6c9200462169081a4bf8/2023-03/photo1678949552.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T10:38:41.563318+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":568,"images":58,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}